Hi Alfrescan,

=20

I hope you had a nice weekend and a better week in front of you.


What/Where/Why

=20

Recently with @Kristen Gastaldo, we decided to reshape one of the monthly w=
ebinar named Office Hours to engage more with our external Community of deve=
lopers and Tech Enthusiasts. We will be opening a weekly call in Zoom, where=
 everyone can come if he/she needs help or wants to offer help. Or maybe if =
he/she wants to meet other Alfresco  enthusiasts and talk about his/her proj=
ects or plans.

=20

It will be a time where me and Kristen (at least) will be present, hopefull=
y along with other Alfrescans (based on your availability).

No planned content.

No slides.

No predefined agenda.

No preparation required.

Only a room where to enter, meet and have a chat.

=20

You can find more info here:
https://community.alfresco.com/community/connect/blog/2018/06/01/the-new-of=
fice-hours

=20

Who

=20

All Alfrescans, Partners, Customers, Alfresco enthusiasts, newbies are invi=
ted to join us.

Engineers, Pre-Sales, Support, Sales, Education, Marketing =E2=80=A6 everyone is =
welcome there.

=20

Please spread the word internally and externally to let everyone know about=
 this nice opportunity to stay all together and get in touch.

=20

When

=20

We will start next Thursday, 7th of June at 5:30 CEST for one hour (the Zoo=
m link will be shared soon).

We plan to do it every week.

=20

Disclaimer

=20

You probably imagine that this won=E2=80=99t be the place to =E2=80=9Csolve problems=E2=80=9D=
, but it will be the place to meet and talk.

Me and Kristen will be clear with all the attendees, but we all think it is=
 a nice opportunity to be more open and transparent with our external Commun=
ity of enthusiasts.

=20

Looking forward to see you there.

=20

Cheers,

=20

-Francesco



--B_3613024444_1723715258
